InvoicePaymentReferenceModeHelp=A structured payment reference lets the bank match an incoming payment to the invoice automatically. The format follows the country of your company: Belgian structured communication for Belgium, national or RF reference for Finland, DIAS reference for Greece, and the ISO 11649 creditor reference elsewhere. The reference is stored on the invoice when it is validated.
