DIASCode=DIAS merchant code
DIASCodeHelp=Five digit identifier assigned by your greek bank when you register with DIAS. It cannot be chosen freely.<br><br>It is only used when Dolibarr builds a reference. If you already issue a reference and write it here or on a third party, that reference is used as it is and this code changes nothing.<br><br>If you already issue a reference, the code is the five digits that follow RF and its two check digits, so RF20 92192 ... means the code is 92192. Otherwise ask your bank.
